{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q416421","formula":"CI₄","hill":"CI4","elements":["C","I"],"composition":{"C":1.0,"I":4.0},"names":{"en":"Carbon tetraiodide","ru":"Тетраиодметан"},"descriptions":{"en":"Carbon tetraiodide is a tetrahalomethane with the molecular formula CI4. Being bright red, it is a relatively rare example of a highly colored methane derivative. It is only 2.3% by weight carbon, although other methane derivatives are known with still less carbon.","ru":"Тетраиодмета́н (тетраиоди́д углеро́да, иоди́д углеро́да(IV), четырёхио́дистый углеро́д) — химическое органическое вещество; полностью замещённое галогенпроизводное метана. При нормальных условиях существует в виде красных кристаллов. Применяется в органическом синтезе как иодирующий реагент."},"fame":24,"pubchemCid":10487,"mass":519.628,"charge":0,"smiles":"C(I)(I)(I)I","inchikey":"JOHCVVJGGSABQY-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"tetraiodomethane","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"10487","atoms":5,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":1.17,"y":1.361,"z":-1.055,"el":"I"},{"x":-1.245,"y":1.028,"z":1.314,"el":"I"},{"x":1.233,"y":-1.287,"z":1.075,"el":"I"},{"x":-1.158,"y":-1.101,"z":-1.334,"el":"I"},{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0,"el":"C"}],"bonds":[[0,4,1],[1,4,1],[2,4,1],[3,4,1]]},"sources":[{"role":"identity","name":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q416421","license":"CC0 1.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (en)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carbon_tetraiodide","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (ru)","url":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%A2%D0%B5%D1%82%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B8%D0%BE%D0%B4%D0%BC%D0%B5%D1%82%D0%B0%D0%BD","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"properties","name":"PubChem","url":"https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/compound/10487","license":"PubC